の週間」です。\n\n日々、様々な場所で任務にあたる自衛隊員。\n\nその一人ひとりを一番身近で支えてくださっている御家族も、我が国の防衛を支える大切な一員です。 https://t.co/vxK2AORjY2","id_str":"2118569065128013983","is_quote_status":true,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":19,"quoted_status_id_str":"2067193781309628457","quoted_status_permalink":{"display":"x.com/ModJapan_jp/st…","expanded":"https://twitter.com/ModJapan_jp/status/2067193781309628457","url":"https://t.co/wNuAG9XEx2"},"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":212,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"268732024"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTg1NjkwNjUwODE4NzIzODQ=","text":"【家族と過ごす時間を大切に👪】\n\n11月15日は防衛省の「家族の日」、11月8日～21日は「家族の週間」です。\n\n日々、様々な場所で任務にあたる自衛隊員。\n\nその一人ひとりを一番身近で支えてくださっている御家族も、我が国の防衛を支える大切な一員です。\n\n日頃から隊員を支えてくださる御家族への感謝と、これからの家族支援への思いを、小泉防衛大臣から動画メッセージでお届けします。\n\nぜひ御覧ください。"}}},"quotedRefResult":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","rest_id":"2067193781309628457"}},"rest_id":"2118569065128013983","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"125218","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2121135980333732305","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"38583","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2121135980333732305","sortIndex":"2121441624188780467"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"rest_id":"https://t.co/zCF8NXNzxj"},"cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":3},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/9966396012